    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds a bit too \"on the one hand, on the other hand.\" If you look at the actual data from places that have tried it, doesn't the evidence generally show that the capital flight and loss of investment are the much larger, more certain risks compared to the theoretical benefits of redistribution?",
